# KYC/AML Customer Onboarding Enhancement

## Overview
This project aims to enhance the KYC (Know Your Customer) onboarding process for a fintech platform by improving user experience, reducing onboarding time, and ensuring compliance with AML (Anti-Money Laundering) standards.

## Problem
Existing KYC onboarding was slow, leading to high customer drop-off rates. Manual document uploads and lack of progress indicators frustrated users and delayed verification.

## Solution
Develop an enhanced eKYC onboarding flow with real-time document verification, smart re-upload prompts, and onboarding progress tracking.

## My Role
- Gathered and refined regulatory requirements (FINTRAC, FATF standards).
- Created user stories and acceptance criteria.
- Designed onboarding workflows using BPMN 2.0.
- Coordinated UAT preparation and defect triaging.
- Benchmarked competitor flows to suggest UX improvements.

